# LF everywhere: scoop's Git turns on core.autocrlf, which checks out CRLF on Windows, and
# the Dockerfile copies the whole checkout into the image. The SkillSpector baselines for
# the vendored shipped skills are fingerprints over LF bytes, so CRLF copies make the scan
# reject findings that the baselines accept.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.png binary
